OL,3,AI've seen nearly 500 executions - but
OL,4,Anever one like Christa Pike's
OL,5,
OL,6,FReporter Michael Graczyk has covered
OL,7,Fnearly 500 executions carried out in
OL,8,FTexas, continuing even after his 2018
OL,9,Fretirement from The Associated Press.
OL,11,FHe remembers two instances where
OL,12,Fneedles popped out before reinsertion
OL,13,Ffor successful execution - but never
OL,14,Fone in which an inmate survived.
OL,16,FThat's what happened this week in
OL,17,FTennessee, when 50-year-old inmate
OL,18,FChrista Pike remained breathing and
OL,19,Faudibly snoring after two separate
OL,20,Fdoses of pentobarbital, the barbiturate
OL,21,Fused in the state's lethal injection
OL,22,Fprotocol.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
