OL,3,AI've seen nearly 500 executions - but
OL,4,Anever one like Christa Pike's
OL,5,
OL,6,FGraczyk, 76, says he wasn't entirely
OL,7,Fsurprised to hear of the anomaly - and
OL,8,Fhad actually thought about the
OL,9,Fpossibility during his decades-long
OL,10,Fcareer as a Texas journalist.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
